{"id":"f21a38e1aa36ed85","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/093_Robinson_算术_R.md","title":"093 Robinson 算术 R","display":"093_Robinson_算术_R","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-语言\">1. 语言</h1>\n<p>元层自然数集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var,zero,succ,add,mul\">\\(var,zero,succ,add,mul\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad or,\\quad all.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad or,\\quad all.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>新变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项、数码与公式\">2. 项、数码与公式</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_R\">\\(Tm_R\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_R\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"zero\\in Tm_R\">\\(zero\\in Tm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in Tm_R\">\\(t\\in Tm_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"succ(t)\\in Tm_R\">\\(succ(t)\\in Tm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_R\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"add(s,t)\\in Tm_R\">\\(add(s,t)\\in Tm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_R\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_R\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mul(s,t)\\in Tm_R\">\\(mul(s,t)\\in Tm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>数码函数定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"num_R:\\mathbb N\\to Tm_R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[num_R:\\mathbb N\\to Tm_R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"num_R(0)=zero,\n\\qquad\nnum_R(n+1)=succ(num_R(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[num_R(0)=zero,\n\\qquad\nnum_R(n+1)=succ(num_R(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"num_R(n)\">\\(num_R(n)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_R\">\\(Frm_R\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_R\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_R\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_R\">\\(eq(s,t)\\in Frm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_R\">\\(A\\in Frm_R\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_R\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_R\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_R\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_R\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_R\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_R\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_R\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_R\">\\(A\\in Frm_R\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(x,A)\\in Frm_R\">\\(all(x,A)\\in Frm_R\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量与替换\">3. 自由变量与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T^R:Tm_R\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T^R:Tm_R\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F^R:Frm_R\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F^R:Frm_R\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并在本文件中把它们简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T\">\\(FV_T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F\">\\(FV_F\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>项自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F\">\\(FV_F\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(or(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(or(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^R:Frm_R\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^R:Frm_R\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^R(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\quad\nBV_F^R(neg(A))=BV_F^R(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^R(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\quad\nBV_F^R(neg(A))=BV_F^R(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^R(imp(A,B))=BV_F^R(A)\\cup BV_F^R(B),\n\\quad\nBV_F^R(or(A,B))=BV_F^R(A)\\cup BV_F^R(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^R(imp(A,B))=BV_F^R(A)\\cup BV_F^R(B),\n\\quad\nBV_F^R(or(A,B))=BV_F^R(A)\\cup BV_F^R(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^R(all(x,A))=BV_F^R(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^R(all(x,A))=BV_F^R(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"zero[x:=s]=zero,\\quad succ(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[zero[x:=s]=zero,\\quad succ(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nmul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nmul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[imp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)[x:=s]=or(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[or(A,B)[x:=s]=or(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)\">\\(all(y,A)\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nall(y,A),&amp;y=x,\\\\\nall(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\nall(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nall(y,A),&amp;y=x,\\\\\nall(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\nall(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数的域和值域为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^R:Tm_R\\times Var\\times Tm_R\\to Tm_R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^R:Tm_R\\times Var\\times Tm_R\\to Tm_R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^R:Frm_R\\times Var\\times Tm_R\\to Frm_R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^R:Frm_R\\times Var\\times Tm_R\\to Frm_R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]=Sub_T^R(t,x,s)\">\\(t[x:=s]=Sub_T^R(t,x,s)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]=Sub_F^R(A,x,s)\">\\(A[x:=s]=Sub_F^R(A,x,s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^R\\subseteq Frm_R\\times Frm_R\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^R\\subseteq Frm_R\\times Frm_R\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_R\">\\(Frm_R\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(neg(A),neg(B))\\in E\">\\((neg(A),neg(B))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1))\\in E\">\\((imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(or(A_0,A_1),or(B_0,B_1))\\in E\">\\((or(A_0,A_1),or(B_0,B_1))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(all(x,A),all(x,B))\\in E\">\\((all(x,A),all(x,B))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in Var\">\\(x,y\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_R\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_R\\)</span>，定义派生公式</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Le_R(s,t)=neg(all(z,neg(eq(add(s,var(z)),t)))),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Le_R(s,t)=neg(all(z,neg(eq(add(s,var(z)),t)))),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=fresh(FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Le_R(s,t)\">\\(Le_R(s,t)\\)</span> 表示“存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+z=t\">\\(s+z=t\\)</span>”；它不是新的公式构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-逻辑公理与规则\">4. 逻辑公理与规则</h1>\n<p>逻辑公理集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{log}^R\">\\(Ax_{log}^R\\)</span> 是下列局部公理族的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to1}^R=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_R\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to1}^R=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_R\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to2}^R\n=\n\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_R\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to2}^R\n=\n\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_R\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to3}^R\n=\n\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_R\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to3}^R\n=\n\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_R\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall1}^R\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_R,t\\in Tm_R\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall1}^R\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_R,t\\in Tm_R\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall2}^R\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_R,x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall2}^R\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_R,x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=1}^R=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_R\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=1}^R=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_R\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=2}^R\n=\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_R,t,u\\in Tm_R\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=2}^R\n=\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_R,t,u\\in Tm_R\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及析取定义集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\vee}^R\n=\n\\{imp(A,or(A,B)):A,B\\in Frm_R\\}\n\\cup\n\\{imp(B,or(A,B)):A,B\\in Frm_R\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\vee}^R\n=\n\\{imp(A,or(A,B)):A,B\\in Frm_R\\}\n\\cup\n\\{imp(B,or(A,B)):A,B\\in Frm_R\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{imp(imp(A,C),imp(imp(B,C),imp(or(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{imp(imp(A,C),imp(imp(B,C),imp(or(A,B),C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{log}^R\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^R\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^R\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^R\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^R\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^R\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^R\\cup Ax_{=2}^R\\cup Ax_{\\vee}^R,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{log}^R\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^R\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^R\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^R\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^R\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^R\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^R\\cup Ax_{=2}^R\\cup Ax_{\\vee}^R,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>推理规则为下列带类型关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^R B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^R B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\to^R\n=\n\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_R\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\to^R\n=\n\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_R\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\forall^R\n=\n\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_R,\\ x\\in Var\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\forall^R\n=\n\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_R,\\ x\\in Var\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha^R\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_R,\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha^R B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\alpha^R\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_R,\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha^R B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-Robinson-R-数码闭公理\">5. Robinson R 数码闭公理</h1>\n<p>数码计算公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{R,+}\n=\n\\{eq(add(\\bar m,\\bar n),\\overline{m+n}):m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{R,+}\n=\n\\{eq(add(\\bar m,\\bar n),\\overline{m+n}):m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{R,\\times}\n=\n\\{eq(mul(\\bar m,\\bar n),\\overline{mn}):m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{R,\\times}\n=\n\\{eq(mul(\\bar m,\\bar n),\\overline{mn}):m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>数码分离公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{R,\\ne}\n=\n\\{neg(eq(\\bar m,\\bar n)):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\ne n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{R,\\ne}\n=\n\\{neg(eq(\\bar m,\\bar n)):m,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ m\\ne n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-Robinson-R-前段覆盖公理\">6. Robinson R 前段覆盖公理</h1>\n<p>定义有限析取族。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Disj_n:(n+1\\to Frm_R)\\to Frm_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Disj_n:(n+1\\to Frm_R)\\to Frm_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Disj_n(A_0,\\ldots,A_n)\">\\(Disj_n(A_0,\\ldots,A_n)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Disj_n(\\tau)\">\\(Disj_n(\\tau)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(i)=A_i\">\\(\\tau(i)=A_i\\)</span>。递归条款为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Disj_0(A_0)=A_0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Disj_0(A_0)=A_0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Disj_{k+1}(A_0,\\ldots,A_{k+1})\n=\nor(Disj_k(A_0,\\ldots,A_k),A_{k+1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Disj_{k+1}(A_0,\\ldots,A_{k+1})\n=\nor(Disj_k(A_0,\\ldots,A_k),A_{k+1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>前段覆盖公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{R,bound}\n=\n\\{imp(Le_R(var(x),\\bar n),\nDisj_n(eq(var(x),\\bar0),\\ldots,eq(var(x),\\bar n))):x\\in Var,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{R,bound}\n=\n\\{imp(Le_R(var(x),\\bar n),\nDisj_n(eq(var(x),\\bar0),\\ldots,eq(var(x),\\bar n))):x\\in Var,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可比性公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{R,comp}\n=\n\\{or(Le_R(var(x),\\bar n),Le_R(\\bar n,var(x))):x\\in Var,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{R,comp}\n=\n\\{or(Le_R(var(x),\\bar n),Le_R(\\bar n,var(x))):x\\in Var,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全体公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_R=Ax_{log}^R\\cup Ax_{R,+}\\cup Ax_{R,\\times}\\cup Ax_{R,\\ne}\\cup Ax_{R,bound}\\cup Ax_{R,comp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_R=Ax_{log}^R\\cup Ax_{R,+}\\cup Ax_{R,\\times}\\cup Ax_{R,\\ne}\\cup Ax_{R,bound}\\cup Ax_{R,comp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义归纳公式族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"IndSch_R\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=zero],imp(all(x,imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),all(x,A))):A\\in Frm_R,\\ x\\in Var\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[IndSch_R\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=zero],imp(all(x,imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),all(x,A))):A\\in Frm_R,\\ x\\in Var\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Robinson R 的目标差异由下式给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{Ax_{R,+},Ax_{R,\\times},Ax_{R,\\ne},Ax_{R,bound},Ax_{R,comp}\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Ax_R),\n\\qquad\nAx_R\\cap IndSch_R=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{Ax_{R,+},Ax_{R,\\times},Ax_{R,\\ne},Ax_{R,bound},Ax_{R,comp}\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Ax_R),\n\\qquad\nAx_R\\cap IndSch_R=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分对象定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_R\n=\n\\bigl((Disj_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\ Ax_{R,+},\\ Ax_{R,\\times},\\ Ax_{R,\\ne},\\ Ax_{R,bound},\\ Ax_{R,comp},\\ IndSch_R,\\ Ax_R\\cap IndSch_R\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_R\n=\n\\bigl((Disj_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\ Ax_{R,+},\\ Ax_{R,\\times},\\ Ax_{R,\\ne},\\ Ax_{R,bound},\\ Ax_{R,comp},\\ IndSch_R,\\ Ax_R\\cap IndSch_R\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义行许可谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_R(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_R(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\)</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_R\n\\land\n\\pi(i)\\in Frm_R\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_R\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_R\n\\land\n\\pi(i)\\in Frm_R\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_R\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vee\n\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\to^R)\n\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\\n\\bigl(\\pi(i)=all(x,\\pi(j))\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vee\n\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\to^R)\n\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\\n\\bigl(\\pi(i)=all(x,\\pi(j))\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\alpha^R)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\alpha^R)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_R(\\Gamma,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_R(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\n\\land\n\\pi:m\\to Frm_R\n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_R(\\Gamma,\\pi,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\n\\land\n\\pi:m\\to Frm_R\n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_R(\\Gamma,\\pi,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义末行关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Last}_R(\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Last}_R(\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\land \\pi:m\\to Frm_R\\land \\pi(m-1)=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\land \\pi:m\\to Frm_R\\land \\pi(m-1)=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_R A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_R A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists \\pi\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_R(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\land \\operatorname{Last}_R(\\pi,A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists \\pi\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_R(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\land \\operatorname{Last}_R(\\pi,A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Thm_R\n=\n\\{A\\in Frm_R:\\varnothing\\vdash_R A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Thm_R\n=\n\\{A\\in Frm_R:\\varnothing\\vdash_R A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_R,\nFrm_R,\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_F^R,\nfresh,\nSub_T^R,\nSub_F^R,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^R,\nnum_R,\n(Disj_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\nLe_R,\nAx_R,\nIndSch_R,\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_R,\nRule_\\to^R,\nRule_\\forall^R,\nRule_\\alpha^R,\nProof_R,\n\\operatorname{Last}_R,\n\\vdash_R,\nThm_R,\n\\Delta_R\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_R,\nFrm_R,\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_F^R,\nfresh,\nSub_T^R,\nSub_F^R,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^R,\nnum_R,\n(Disj_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\nLe_R,\nAx_R,\nIndSch_R,\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_R,\nRule_\\to^R,\nRule_\\forall^R,\nRule_\\alpha^R,\nProof_R,\n\\operatorname{Last}_R,\n\\vdash_R,\nThm_R,\n\\Delta_R\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含本地逻辑演算、数码计算、数码分离、前段覆盖与数码可比性公理；不含 Q 的后继前驱公理、归纳公理或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-语言","text":"1. 语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、数码与公式","text":"2. 项、数码与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量与替换","text":"3. 自由变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-逻辑公理与规则","text":"4. 逻辑公理与规则","level":1},{"id":"5.-Robinson-R-数码闭公理","text":"5. Robinson R 数码闭公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-Robinson-R-前段覆盖公理","text":"6. Robinson R 前段覆盖公理","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false